OL,3,GNEWSABody found in search for missing
OL,4,Ahillwalker on Isle of Skye
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice searching for a 45-year-old
OL,7,Ftourist who went missing while
OL,8,Fhillwalking on the Isle of Skye have
OL,9,Fdiscovered a body.
OL,11,FHector Patemore, from the Belgian city
OL,12,Fof Ghent, was last seen at about 10:45
OL,13,Fon Sunday when he left Glenbrittle
OL,14,FYouth Hostel to begin his walk.
OL,16,FThe body was found in the Cuillin area
OL,17,Fof Skye at about 14:00.
OL,19,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said
OL,20,Fformal identification had yet to take
OL,21,Fplace but the missing man's family had
OL,22,Fbeen informed.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
